/github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106985#issuecomment-2924548014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106985","id":2924548014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uUQ-u","user":{"login":"gmikhail","id":4838367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzgzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4838367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail","html_url":"https://github.com/gmikhail","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmikhail/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T07:05:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T07:05:07Z","body":"@Summersay415 As discussed [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6298), most agreed with `autofocus` which is consistent with the HTML attribute name.\r\n\r\nSummary of the discussion:\r\n- 4 votes for `autofocus`\r\n- 2 votes for `focus_on_ready`\r\n- One vote for `show_focused`, `focus_on_show`, `grab_focus_on_ready`","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924548014/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924548887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106985#issuecomment-2924548887"